  "details": "VRCPS\n\na solution to the age old complaint about a lack of internal messaging systems\n\nI got inspiration from the recent “Prints” feature yall put out for the beta channels and thought about how they could be better used if I could send them to people, then the idea for the \n\n__V\n\n__R\n\n__Chat\n\n__Postal\n\n__Service\n\nPopped in my head, what if all users had a tangible mailbox they could summon maybe even the ability to customize the mailboxes with stickers and similar ways of personalization (similar to a sharing podium) and inside said mail box they could receive letters from other users, just simple messages and pictures in the neat little packing of a letter. I think it would be a really novel way to handle the messaging issue and who doesn’t enjoy receiving letters from their friends\n\nYou can even put the buttons on the backs of the letters to make them faster to send and more convenient like you did with the prints",
